WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Split screen.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:05.530
On the left, a woman walks through
a crowd that parts around her.

3
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.980
Every eye turns to the
red letter on her dress.

4
00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:13.100
On the right, a minister preaches
to an adoring congregation,

5
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.470
one hand pressed over his heart.

6
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.740
Under his hand, something faintly glows.

7
00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.390
Only we can see it.

8
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.180
Her sin is public.

9
00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.920
His is secret.

10
00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:25.750
So which hurts more?

11
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.580
In this mission, you'll see how
Puritan Boston punished sin,

12
00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:32.000
with shame in front of the whole town.

13
00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:35.230
You'll hear the minister speak
about penance and penitence,

14
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.280
and why they aren't the same thing.

15
00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:41.290
And you'll find out what the letter seems
to tell Hester about everyone else in

16
00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.300
town.

17
00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:45.650
Your mission: decide which sin hurts more.
